config U30PRO_SPRD_SIP
 bool "Unisoc SIP firmware service (SMC to the secure monitor, DVFS part)"
 depends on ARM64 && HAVE_ARM_SMCCC
 help
   The CPU frequency tables, clock switching and core voltage control of the UMS9632 live in the secure monitor.  This provides the
   SMC calls the apcpu cpufreq driver needs.  When the firmware does not answer the DVFS revision call the service stays off.
